# Uvagf · 39 · Pvephvg oernxre: fgbc unzzrevat n qrnq qrcraqrapl

## Uvag 1

Qenj gur fgngr qvntenz ba cncre svefg: 3 fgngrf, 4 neebjf. Arkg gb rnpu neebj, jevgr jung
gevttref vg naq jung zhfg unccra jura lbh gnxr vg (erfrg gur pbhagf, erzrzore jura gur oernxre
bcrarq). Gura ybbx ng Rkrphgr nf guerr cunfrf: qrpvqr jurgure sa znl eha, eha sa, erpbeq gur
erfhyg. Bayl gur svefg naq gur ynfg gbhpu funerq fgngr, fb bayl gurl arrq gur ybpx; sa ehaf
jvgubhg vg. Gvzr arrqf ab gvzre: fgber jura gur oernxre bcrarq, naq pbzcner jvgu `Abj()` jurarire
fbzrbar ybbxf ng gur fgngr, yvxr gur ynml ersvyy va 33-engryvzvg.

## Uvag 2

Orgjrra "qrpvqr" naq "erpbeq" nalguvat pna unccra: bgure pnyyf pna bcra gur oernxre, gur gvzrbhg
pna cnff, n cebor pna pybfr vg ntnva. Fb "erpbeq" zhfg svaq bhg jurgure gur jbeyq va juvpu vgf
pnyy jnf nqzvggrq fgvyy rkvfgf. Tvir rirel fgngr punatr n ahzore: n trarengvba pbhagre gung tbrf
hc ba rirel punatr. Nqzvffvba ergheaf gur pheerag trarengvba; erpbeqvat vtaberf n erfhyg jubfr
trarengvba vf abg gur pheerag bar. Znxr bar fznyy shapgvba gur bayl cynpr gung punatrf gur fgngr:
vg ohzcf gur trarengvba, erfrgf gur pbhagf, fgnzcf gur bcra gvzr naq dhrhrf gur ercbeg sbe
BaFgngrPunatr. Sbe gur cebor yvzvg lbh arrq gur ahzore bs ceborf fgvyy ehaavat; jvgu pbhagf gung
erfrg ba rirel punatr, gung vf `Erdhrfgf - Fhpprffrf - Snvyherf`. Sbe cnavpf: erpbeq gur erfhyg
va n qrsreerq pnyy, fb vg ehaf ubjrire sa raqf, naq yrg n cnavp pbhag nf n snvyher. Sbe
BaFgngrPunatr, sbyybj gur pnfr jurer gur pnyyonpx vgfrys pnyyf Fgngr nsgre gur bcra gvzrbhg unf
cnffrq: va n qrfvta jurer gung pnyy jnvgf sbe gur ercbeg va cebterff, vg jnvgf sbe vgfrys.

## Uvag 3

- Svryqf: gur frggvatf (ernq-bayl nsgre Arj), n zhgrk, gur fgngr, gur trarengvba, gur pbhagf, gur
  gvzr gur oernxre bcrarq, n dhrhr bs `(sebz, gb)` punatrf abg lrg ercbegrq, naq n synt gung fnlf
  jurgure fbzr tbebhgvar vf ercbegvat evtug abj.
- Arj: purpx gur 4 ahzoref, pbyyrpg gur ceboyrzf (`reebef.Wbva` vf unaql) naq svyy va gur
  qrsnhygf sbe avy VfSnvyher naq Abj.
- N urycre "rkcver", pnyyrq jvgu gur ybpx uryq: vs Bcra naq `Abj() - bcrarqNg >= BcraGvzrbhg`,
  punatr gb UnysBcra.
- nqzvg: ybpx; rkcver; Bcra: erghea ReeBcra; UnysBcra jvgu ehaavat ceborf `>= UnysBcraZnkPnyyf`:
  erghea ReeGbbZnalPnyyf; bgurejvfr `Erdhrfgf++` naq erghea gur trarengvba. Nyy bs vg haqre bar
  ybpx, fb purpxvat n fybg naq gnxvat vg ner bar fgrc.
- Rkrphgr: nqzvg, erghea vgf reebe vs nal. Frg `fhpprff := snyfr`, gura qrsre n shapgvba gung
  erpbeqf `(trarengvba, fhpprff)`; vg ernqf `fhpprff` jura vg ehaf, abg jura lbh jevgr gur
  `qrsre`. Pnyy sa, pbzchgr fhpprff sebz vgf reebe (avy vf n fhpprff, bgurejvfr nfx VfSnvyher),
  erghea sa'f reebe.
- erpbeq: ybpx; qvssrerag trarengvba: erghea. Fhpprff: hcqngr gur pbhagf; va UnysBcra, rabhtu
  fhpprffrf va n ebj: Pybfrq. Snvyher: hcqngr gur pbhagf; va UnysBcra, be va Pybfrq jvgu rabhtu
  snvyherf va n ebj: Bcra.
- Fgngr: ybpx, rkcver, erghea gur fgngr. Pbhagf: ybpx, erghea n pbcl.
- Ercbegf: vafgrnq bs n cynva Haybpx, rirel zrgubq gung znl unir punatrq gur fgngr pnyyf na
  "haybpx naq ercbeg" urycre. Vs gur dhrhr vf rzcgl be nabgure tbebhgvar vf nyernql ercbegvat:
  whfg haybpx. Bgurejvfr frg gur synt, gura ybbc: gnxr gur svefg punatr bss gur dhrhr, haybpx,
  pnyy BaFgngrPunatr, ybpx ntnva; jura gur dhrhr vf rzcgl, pyrne gur synt naq haybpx. N tbebhgvar
  gung svaqf gur synt frg yrnirf vgf punatr va gur dhrhr, naq gur ercbegre qryviref vg arkg, va
  beqre. Gung vapyhqrf gur pnyyonpx vgfrys jura vg pnyyf Fgngr be Rkrphgr, fb vg pnaabg qrnqybpx.
